## Income Group Derivation

### Transaction-Level (Reference)
**Method**: Quartile-based on Transaction_Amount

| Group | Boundary | Count | Percentage |
|-------|----------|-------|------------|
| Low | ≤ $1,260 (Q1) | 1,251 | 25% |
| Medium | $1,260 - $3,682 (Q1-Q3) | 2,501 | 50% |
| High | > $3,682 (Q3) | 1,248 | 25% |

### Customer-Level Primary_Income_Group
**Method**: Quartile-based on **Total_Spending** (aggregated customer spending)

| Group | Boundary | Customers | Percentage | Avg Spending |
|-------|----------|-----------|------------|--------------|
| Low | ≤ $7,777 (Q1) | ~248 | ~25% | ~$5,500 |
| Medium | $7,777 - $16,531 (Q1-Q3) | ~497 | ~50% | ~$12,000 |
| High | > $16,531 (Q3) | ~248 | ~25% | ~$21,000 |

Based on total customer behavior (not individual transactions), more representative of income capacity.

